    "source": "nerdc",
    "strand": "Number and Numeration",
    "objective": "Apply counting to local counting in groups of fives (yams, oranges, onions), market days",
    "note": "NERDC frames this as local market counting, alongside sevens and sixties, which have no plan yet."
